---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../../lib/site';
---
<Layout
  title={`隐私政策 · ${SITE.name}`}
  description={`${SITE.name} 隐私政策。`}
  canonicalPath="/privacy/"
  lang="zh"
>
  <div class="page-head wrap"><h1>隐私政策</h1><p>照片和成片保留多久。</p></div>
  <section class="section wrap prose">
    <p>仅限宠物照片。请勿上传人。上传的照片大约保留 {SITE.photoRetentionDays} 天。成片（如果任务有成片）大约保留 {SITE.videoRetentionDays} 天。</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
